  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - It is considered that because the site already benefits from rear garden parking the proposed vehicle access to the forecourt would be harmful to pedestrian and vehicle safety on this busy road. The significant amount of existing parking on the footway within the vicinity and the established tree located at the front of the site would also constitute a hazard to sight lines and therefore to the free flow and safety of pedestrian and vehicle traffic on the adjoining highway. Therefore the proposed development is not in accordance with policies T.4.4 and T.5.3 of adopted London Borough of Hounslow Unitary Development Plan."
